      "text": "1. Formula of chloride of trivalent metal M is $\\mathrm{MCl}_3$.\n$\\therefore$ Balanced chemical equation is $\\mathrm{MCl}_3 +$\n$3\\mathrm{NH}_4\\mathrm{OH} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{M}(\\mathrm{OH})_3 + 3\\mathrm{NH}_4\\mathrm{Cl}$.\nHence, the correct option is (d)."
