      "layout_tag": "paragraph",
      "confidence": 0.9056902527809143,
      "reading_order": 5,
      "text": "2. Valency of non-metal X in $\\mathrm{XH}_3$ with respect\nto H is 3. Given that valencies of X in the two\noxides are 2 and 4 with respect to oxygen, and\nformulae of oxides are $\\mathrm{XO}$ and $\\mathrm{XO}_2$.\nHence, the correct option is (a)."
    },
    {
